  !>                 \ref rocsolver_ssytrd "SYTRD".
  !>     @param[inout] C - pointer to type. Array on the GPU of size ldc*n.
  !>                 On entry, the matrix C. On exit, it is overwritten with
  !>                 \f$QC\f$, \f$CQ\f$, \f$Q^TC\f$, or \f$CQ^T\f$.
