  !>                 On entry, the matrix C. On exit, it is overwritten with \f$Q^H C\f$.
  !>                 (Not referenced if nc = 0.)
  !>     @param[in] ldc - rocblas_int. ldc >= n if nc > 0, or ldc >=1 if nc = 0.
