  !>                 Specifies the leading dimension of matrices B_l.
  !>     @param[out] D - pointer to type. Array on the GPU (the size depends on the value of
  !>     strideD).
  !>                 The eigenvalues in increasing order.
  !>     @param[in] strideD - rocblas_stride.
